 "purpose": "Makes one real screenshot of the clock window next to a full-screen terminal for the handbook (Linux with Xvfb, openbox, xterm, xdotool and ImageMagick).",
 "details": "main(python) starts a virtual display, a window manager and a maximised xterm that runs the program on the sample data (schermafdrukken.maak_voorbeeld) with a fixed seed, presses keys with xdotool to reach a clock question, captures the display with ImageMagick and writes docs/handleiding/beelden/klokvenster-scherm.png (the only PNG in the repo). It exits with a list of missing tools if any is absent. A python with tkinter must be passed as an argument when the default has none.",
 "module_docstring": "Een echte schermafdruk van het klokvenster naast een terminal op het hele scherm (voor de handleiding).",
